Description: Provides ExperimentHub metadata and documentation for immutable
    promoter-background score distributions used by PscanR transcription
    factor binding motif enrichment analyses. Backgrounds cover JASPAR 2020,
    2022, and 2024 motif collections, seven genome assemblies, and five
    promoter windows.
